<elements>
	<info>
		<name>Abyss-Touched</name>
		<description>Abyss-Touched background — Shvall, ATÉRIOR.</description>
		<author>Falling-Cats</author>
		<update version="0.0.1">
			<file name="background-abyss-touched.xml" url="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Falling-Cats/aterior-aurora/main/Backgrounds/background-abyss-touched.xml" />
		</update>
	</info>
	<element name="Abyss-Touched" type="Background" source="ATÉRIOR" id="ID_ATERIOR_BACKGROUND_ABYSS_TOUCHED">
		<description>
			<ul class="unstyled" style="text-indent:-1em; margin-left:1em; margin-bottom:5px">
				<li><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Constitution, Dexterity, Wisdom</li>
				<li><strong>Feat:</strong> Magic Initiate (Druid)</li>
				<li><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Survival and Arcana</li>
				<li><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> Herbalism Kit</li>
				<li><strong>Equipment:</strong><i> Choose A or B:</i> (A) Bedroll, Waterskin, Rope (50 ft), Torches (5), Traveler's Clothes, 15 GP; or (B) 50 GP</li>
			</ul>
			<p>Your life was touched by the Shvall Abyss — an expedition you survived, an upbringing near its edge, or a change worked in you by something that came out of it. The Abyss is a place where magic behaves strangely, and expeditions regularly return changed, or don't return at all.</p>
		</description>
		<setters>
			<set name="short">Constitution, Dexterity, Wisdom, Magic Initiate (Druid) Feat, Survival and Arcana Skills, Herbalism Kit</set>
		</setters>
		<rules>
			<grant type="Ability Score Improvement" id="ID_INTERNAL_ABILITY_SCORE_IMPROVEMENT_COMBINATION_CON_DEX_WIS" />
			<grant type="Feat" id="ID_WOTC_PHB24_FEAT_MAGIC_INITIATE_DRUID" />
			<grant type="Proficiency" id="ID_PROFICIENCY_SKILL_SURVIVAL" />
			<grant type="Proficiency" id="ID_PROFICIENCY_SKILL_ARCANA" />
			<grant type="Grants" id="ID_INTERNAL_GRANTS_BACKGROUND_ASI" />
			<grant type="Proficiency" id="ID_PROFICIENCY_TOOL_PROFICIENCY_HERBALISM_KIT" />
		</rules>
	</element>
</elements>
